  "body": "Welcome to 39 Pinecrest Drive, Gulf Harbour - a beautifully presented near-new home, completed in 2024, offering modern living with an easy-care lifestyle.\r\n\r\nFeaturing four generous bedrooms, three bathrooms, and a spacious open-plan living, dining, and kitchen area, this home is designed for comfortable family living. The modern kitchen is equipped with quality appliances, while a air conditioning, and gas hot water provide year-round comfort.\r\n\r\nStep outside to a sunny deck, perfect for relaxing or entertaining. Set on a low-maintenance section, you'll spend less time on gardening and more time enjoying your weekends - ideal for busy families, professionals, or those looking to downsize without compromising on space.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for your next family home or a smart investment, this property is an excellent choice. For added peace of mind, the balance of the 10-Year Stamford Building Warranty is transferable to the new owner.\r\n\r\nComplete with a double internal-access garage and located in a peaceful Gulf Harbour neighbourhood close to schools, shops, parks, and the marina, this home is ready for you to move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nContact us today for viewing \r\n\r\nAll agents are welcome from day one!\r\n\r\nTo view/download the property documents copy this link into your browser: \r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/MVYJ",
